<title>POLAND: Stalexport Q4 net falls to PLN 2.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Stalexport Q4 net falls to PLN 2.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stalexport SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996	Q4 1995</p>
<p>    profit on economic activity	  5.48 vs    15.42</p>
